<title>BELGIUM: KB Lux 1996 group net profit up 11.5 pct.</title>
<headline>KB Lux 1996 group net profit up 11.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		   4.1 vs   3.7, up 11.5 pct</p>
<p>    Cons total assets on Dec 31  714.3 vs 631.8, up 13.0 pct</p>
<p>    Non-cons balance sheet total 660.8 vs   n/a, up  7.4 pct</p>
<p>    Parent company net profit	3.8 vs   3.4, up 11.0 pct</p>
<p>    Gross dividend/share (francs)2,409 vs 2,171, up 11.0 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Kredietbank Luxembourg (KBL) is part of the Almanij group.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
